# ripgrep (and fd) read this file. A plain `rg` from the repo root skips hidden folders, so these
# lines let it search our tracked dot folders. .gitignore still decides what is skipped inside them
# (node_modules, dist, runs, .claude/worktrees).
!.agents/
!.claude/
!.decisions/
!.fabrika/
!.github/
!.glossary/
!.patterns/
!.runbooks/
